<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home published | Staywise</title>
    <link href="/styles/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center bg-sand px-6 text-ink">
    <main class="w-full max-w-xl rounded-3xl border border-ink/8 bg-white p-8 text-center shadow-2xl shadow-ink/10 sm:p-14">
        <div class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#dbe7e2] text-2xl font-bold text-[#567568]">OK</div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-coral">You are ready to host</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Your home is on its way.</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-sm leading-7 text-ink/60">Thanks for sharing your space. We will help the right guests find it.</p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-[#ff385c] px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#e92f51]">Browse stays</a><a href="/add-home" class="rounded-full border border-[#18212b]/15 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold transition hover:border-[#ff385c] hover:text-[#ff385c]">Add another home</a></div>
    </main>
